====== TP-Link TD-W8970 v1 ======

{{ media:tplink:td-w8970:td-w8970-v1.png?200|TD-W8970 v1.0}}

The TD-W8970 v1 is a 450Mbps Wireless N Gigabit ADSL2+ / VDSL2 Modem Router, but is marketed as a 300Mbps and only ADSL2+ capable product.
The Router is based on a ''[[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.lantiq|Lantiq]]'' SoC.

The [[toh:tp-link:td-w8970_v3.0|TD-W8970 v3]] is a Broadcom router which is not supported by OpenWrt.

The TD-W8970 v1 is very similar to the [[td-w8980_v1|TD-W8980]] and [[td-w9980|TD-W9980]]. 


